sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Officer as Legal Officer / Background Worker
    participant ECourtsCtrl as ECourtsController
    participant SyncEngine as NapixSyncEngine
    participant QuotaSvc as NapixQuotaService
    participant CircuitBrk as CircuitBreaker
    participant CryptoSvc as ECourtsNapixService (AES-128-CBC)
    participant NICGateway as NIC NAPIX e-Courts Gateway (v1.3)
    participant Database as SQL Server (Admin_Law)

    Officer->>ECourtsCtrl: POST /ECourts/QueueCaseSync (CaseID, CNR)
    ECourtsCtrl->>SyncEngine: EnqueueCaseAsync(Module, CaseID, CNR, Priority=1)
    SyncEngine->>Database: INSERT INTO NAPIX_SYNC_QUEUE (Status='PENDING', Priority=1)
    Database-->>SyncEngine: Return QueueID
    SyncEngine-->>ECourtsCtrl: Queued: Success
    ECourtsCtrl-->>Officer: JSON { success: true, message: "Queued for sync" }

    Note over SyncEngine,NICGateway: Background Processor Dequeues Priority 1 Item

    SyncEngine->>QuotaSvc: CheckHourlyQuotaAsync()
    QuotaSvc-->>SyncEngine: Quota OK (Used < 1000/hr, Rate < 20/min)

    SyncEngine->>CircuitBrk: ExecuteAsync(CallNICGateway)
    CircuitBrk->>CryptoSvc: BuildEncryptedPayload(CNRNumber, ClientID)
    Note over CryptoSvc: NIC Spec: AES-128-CBC with Static IV + HMAC-SHA256 Sig

    CryptoSvc->>NICGateway: POST /api/v1/cases/cnr (Encrypted Payload + Bearer Token)
    
    alt NIC Gateway Timeout / 5xx Error
        NICGateway-->>CryptoSvc: HTTP 504 Gateway Timeout
        CryptoSvc-->>CircuitBrk: Exception / Failure
        CircuitBrk->>SyncEngine: Increment AttemptCount (Max 3)
        SyncEngine->>Database: UPDATE NAPIX_SYNC_QUEUE SET Status='RETRY', NextAttempt=Now+Backoff
    else NIC Gateway Success (200 OK)
        NICGateway-->>CryptoSvc: HTTP 200 OK (Encrypted JSON Response)
        CryptoSvc->>CryptoSvc: Decrypt AES-128-CBC Payload & Verify HMAC
        CryptoSvc-->>SyncEngine: Parsed Court Data (Petitioner, Respondent, Next Date, Orders)
        SyncEngine->>Database: UPDATE MVC_CASES SET NextHearingDate, CaseStatus, LastSynced=NOW
        SyncEngine->>Database: INSERT INTO CAUSE_LIST_DETAILS / MVC_CASE_HEARING_DETAILS
        SyncEngine->>Database: UPDATE NAPIX_SYNC_QUEUE SET Status='COMPLETED'
        SyncEngine->>Database: INSERT INTO NAPIX_API_CALLS (Status=200, LatencyMs)
    end
